Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, let's go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.56,0:01:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the moon, the moon will\Nalways come to the moon!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with the sun always in our hearts{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clouds will come and\Nsee the light of the stars.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.23,0:01:20.35,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}If a storm hits, let's put\Nour arms around each other{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.46,0:01:24.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,0)}{\i1}and gaze at the light beyond{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's look at the stars of the stars?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.72,0:01:27.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we gather up the pieces of our dreams{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.04,0:01:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the future, so\NI'll be in the same way.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they'll make a map leading to tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.73,0:01:34.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the same way.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.20,0:01:40.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}under the same flag-- together, we're one{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the same way.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.30,0:01:55.00,Title,,0,0,420,,{\fad(250,250)}Groggy Ring!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sideline supporter from the first\Nround, the Savage Chef Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you mean Stylish Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.94,0:02:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And beside him, with a bounty of 60 million\Nberries, pirate hunter Robo Noah Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly worth our time to squash a\Ncouple of pipsqueaks like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Big Pan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, what do these guys eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, start this out with a coin toss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Field or ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ball, please. You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our groggy monsters have chosen them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats Ballman will now enter the\Nother team's mid-circle, left or right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.42,0:02:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you were wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Ballmen are the players with the\Nsilly little hats on their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock your opponent's Ballman into\Nthe ring on their side of the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the game is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:03:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, ball man! Get in\Nposition already now, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i never agreed to be the\Nball in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better shut your mouth unless\Nyou want to boot to the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am i supposed to look cool with this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing on my head you're\Ngonna cry over a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey that looks good on you you think\Ni'm gonna fall for that stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you i'm sorry we lost the\Nlast round you guys it's up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please get Chopper back! You got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a real wotan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They aren't as large as pure-blooded\Ngiants, but he's still pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother cheering for your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are more than just a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're groggy ring experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, split head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you be so cruel\Nto this sweet, gentle man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're afraid I'm going to\Ninterfere again, then don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't even need to in\Nthis round, you babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you can\Nbutt in on this gang, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, it all depends on how\Nthe captain feels. Naturally,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some pilots like to fight fair and square
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they can test the\Nstrength of their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Others will cheat any way they can\Nto make sure they never lose a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I just do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see why you're complaining\Nabout a little foul play here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're a real pirate, you should\Nbe used to these sorts of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea is treacherous.\NOh, yeah. You would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, your team looks to\Nbe playing a game of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do know the match\Nis about to start, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laugh while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just laid back because\Nthey know they can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw that, cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went too early on that last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just mad because you\Nlost, like you always do. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always lose, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do best three out of five.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just lose again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is the chef your ball man or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what those\Nidiots are arguing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.84,0:05:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, that hat looks great on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ball man's here to kick some ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to admit, it does suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like a real prince\Nfrom the kingdom of lame asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're wasting time start the match you\Nsuck no you suck hey hold it no weapons on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the field pal you gotta lose the swords\Nhuh those the rules yeah because this is a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ball game can't have you slicing each
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other up now can we\Nfine my fists are all i
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,need you sure you're gonna be okay out there\NA swordsman without his swords is just,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A normal guy, only lamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't even a good bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It certainly took long enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it looks like the\NStraw Hat's ball man is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finally making his way\Nto the opponent's circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cook, hope you\Nget trampled out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love yours. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crowd is hungry for action today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Pan, are you ready to\Nmake some grown men cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that funny. Stop laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The groggy monsters are\Nalways up for a good laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, why don't we go\Nover a few quick rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time limit, and\Nthe first team to score wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So all we gotta do to win this is knock\NJumbo's head into the ring on their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard part's gonna be stopping them from\Nplanting the cook's head in our ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can team Straw Hat win\Nback the reindeer they
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lost in round one or will\Nthey lose another member?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, Foxy's\Nreturning champs are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.52,0:07:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,laughing in the face of their competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But will they be the ones to laugh\Nlast the whistle is about to sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the game begin. We\Nstart with Ball Man Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deep in enemy territory\Nwill he retreat or attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this! Tackle\NMachine Pickles takes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a heavy charge\Nokay just gotta head for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their ball man and finish\Nhim off sling tackle
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sling Tackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get out of my way let's\Nsee what you got big man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that fat head of\Nyours fits in the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a ball\Nman fight. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.10,0:07:57.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Collier...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skin's all slimy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chef is slipping and sliding\Non Big Pan's massive arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, Big Pan's a\Nloach fish, loach hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have slippery skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around. Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better watch what\Nyou wish for, sword man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long pass.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.82,0:08:30.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Punk Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it. Big pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super long pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sludgy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Team Captain Hamburg races\Nonto the scene for the catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Zoro is in hot pursuit as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that stupid head of yours\Nmakes it anywhere near the goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to chop it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You talk big, but just\Nwait till I get down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now my sweeping tackle.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.51,0:08:58.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sweeping Tackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pickles crosses over\Nthe rival team's line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Hamburg flies\Nhigh for a fancy minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.43,0:09:10.13,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gorilla Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pickles dashes into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dorry goes for an interception.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.04,0:09:23.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Spinning Tackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spinning Tackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his partner down, Ball Man\NSanji is spiraling into the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bringing up the rear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big pan storms across the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and catches the foley ham bird! Ponderous.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.37,0:09:39.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Punk Receive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, ham bird nabs Sanji\Nwith a perfect catch! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ring is inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go down that easy! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the hamburger dump!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come about!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.72,0:10:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I'm honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ain't over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you've had your fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to put me down, fathead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let Zoro bail me out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never hear the end of Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, Sachi is back on the ground and\Nlooks like he's ready for some more action.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:11:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take care of myself just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you could stay on the ground, ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems our groggy monsters have finally\Nfound some worthy adversaries in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one will be a match to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chirp, chirp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats prevail,\Nbut can they do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've seen pigs fly once\Ntoday, so anything can happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The challengers seem to be\Ndiscussing their next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.86,0:11:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get ready for round two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're cramping my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to the sidelines, Mosshead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it your style to get\Npounded like a punching bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, dude, they're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy picked up\Npickles and tossed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Hamper\Ngo flying like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of the way and I'll win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stay out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.02,0:11:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the ball man, the\Nonly one that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hepberg, what are you doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you lose, I'll never, ever\Nforgive you! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat team seems to be having\Nsome sort of disagreement with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both ball men are still in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so let's hope they can\Nchannel some of that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aggression in a more productive direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two sure are funny, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.57,0:12:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're ball-mans all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gang up on him and knock\Nhim in the ring while
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those other guys are\Nstill out of the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Pan stops him for a surprise\Nattack on the school hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.35,0:12:28.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Too Bad Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't run for the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed to score?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm doing my best here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that guy's got knives on his shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't run away, he's\Ngonna make mulch out of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, ref!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you said we could use weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even trying,\Nis he?! Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:13:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't expect him to catch\Nevery little thing, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw it around!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw you sweating over\Nthere, you little cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a thing. You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's the riff, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yellow card to Sanji of Team Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want another boot to the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only going to make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.06,0:13:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A yellow card for Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one more of those,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the chef will be ejected from\Nthe game once and for all, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll eject you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the threats keep coming in\Nfrom the foul-mouth ball man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows who he'll lash out at next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come down here\Nand say that to my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he, a gangster?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worry about the boots, the ref can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, an axe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't miss that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's got a giant axe you\Ncan see for yourself, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to get a red\Ncard if you don't shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you siding with\Nthem all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to get Julienned out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.36,0:14:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but they're trying to\Nmake you do something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you won't do it for me,\Nat least do it for Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, stand back and let me handle him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we don't need the captain\Nbutting in and complicating things!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tang, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Win the match for me!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.37,0:14:27.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Pose of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now back to the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna do that\Nagain, why even bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running around like this\Nis getting us nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but now that we know their game\Nplan, we can come up with a counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, big man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's payback time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bastard is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of it for the bulk of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:14:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All three are about to collide!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I attack him where his skin's exposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.74,0:15:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just end up slipping\Naround like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That leaves his hands, his feet,\Nhis mask, and his underwear.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.66,0:15:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Loach Scooping Slide!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.36,0:15:20.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Loach Racing Circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes Big Pan's signature move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are about to get slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's afraid of a little skating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, there's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.52,0:15:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to lose my life. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it together, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Pickles and Hattberg have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finally recovered from\Ntheir earlier accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're back in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slaughter them, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that they've\Nupdated their wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their leader, Hamburg, is sporting\Nsome iron knuckles and elbow guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did those come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Pickles has donned\NSpike's shoulder protectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:16:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those clearly violate the no-weapons rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But by complete coincidence, the referee\Nseems to be doing some stretches right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, you can't expect him\Nto catch up or anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for revenge, my\Nfriend, you ready? The
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scrappy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.89,0:16:18.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Loach Coaster!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.22,0:16:27.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Spinning Tackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.08,0:16:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monster
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spawns a counterattack,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this time their\Ntarget isn't the Ballman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his partner, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.34,0:16:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is about to get ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HAMBURGER HEAVEN!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.61,0:16:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hamburger Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HAMBURGER HEAVEN!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SORROW!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the assault isn't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It pan-readies yet another brutal attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamburg is brandishing his mighty elbow
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guards and preparing for\Nan ant-a-crown strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are about to\Nlearn the power of teamwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like an arrow! From the sky. Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.06,0:17:09.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Punk Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haunt attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rat? Cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't be walking that one off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, fatalities are a common\Noccurrence in the groggy ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.02,0:17:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in case you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.08,0:17:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now the Foxy team turns their\Nattention to the straw-hack ballman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.44,0:17:38.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Human...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.11,0:17:40.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pickles and his spikes\Nare closing in fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Move!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.31,0:17:51.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sling Tackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sling Tackle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.24,0:17:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought that was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just getting started!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.86,0:17:58.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Size Attack: S!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:17:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shepard sends them flying back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't even care\Nabout scoring anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.83,0:18:04.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}M!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.87,0:18:08.99,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}L!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Craggy Monster stopped the competition
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flat with a spectacular\Nthree-man team attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a cruel way to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both balls are still in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it looks like Team Straw\NHat is down for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you might say they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all that's left is to stuff\Nthe ball man in his coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it'll be two wins in a\Nrow for the Foxy Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just goes to show you can't\Nkeep a good monster down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we win again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:19:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's work together for ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Against all odds The straw\Nhats are back on their feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after a demoralizing beatdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swordsman without his\Nswords, and the seven-ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.98,0:19:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand tall in the face\Nof adversity once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you gotta scare me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, even if they can stand,\Ndo they have enough strength left to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a little request.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One monster bagger, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh huh. Now what could that\Nmean? Oh, do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our boss has just ordered the\Nfamous monster Starbarker!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that you guys are cheaters and\Nall, but can you at least try to hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does my pick go sour or sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the toppings?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A head of green lettuce and\Nsome fine yellow cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drafts between some big\Npans, what do I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A monster burger for me\Nto eat. Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most terrifying triple attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most horrifying hamburger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems hopeless for the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't help but think\Nthat the Corgi Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,might get handed a red card for such\Na flagrant violation of the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But looking back, what a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The referee just happens to be\Ndoing some stretches right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, he can't catch everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you turn\Naround! Luffy, no! Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want you to get mad so you'll\Nbutt in and do something stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got a grin and fear it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The preparations are complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left now is to sit\Nback and enjoy the carnage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens from here\Non out, don't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, looks like they're going\Nstraight for the ball, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I bless the axe fast,\Nhe'll be grounded, pounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.72,0:21:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spliced and diced, dragged and\Nsmashed into a burger patty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.44,0:21:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.35,0:21:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want a cooking battle, you got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I got to warn you, I've\Nnever cooked scumbags before,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I can't say how it'll turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are mincemeat now! Bust you up.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.48,0:21:51.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Troisième...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.48,0:21:51.12,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Third Rate
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.92,0:21:52.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Haché!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.92,0:21:52.92,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mincemeat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.62,0:21:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Achy!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.51,0:22:09.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bouquetiere...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.51,0:22:09.47,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mixed Vegetables
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Petyo, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop crushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.58,0:22:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up, fatty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, small fry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cut you!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.13,0:22:52.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}No-Sword Style...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.82,0:22:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sword style.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.32,0:22:54.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tatsu?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.61,0:22:57.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Twister
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:22:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mock!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.30,0:23:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saiyan isn't so!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Pan has fallen victims of\Npickle-spinning-play-to-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.76,0:23:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop spinning!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.77,0:23:19.04,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bad Manner...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad Manor!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.18,0:23:26.68,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Kick Course!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.16,0:23:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KICK COURSE!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.38,0:23:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.34,0:23:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only did they knock Big Pan down,\Nthey knocked him right back up too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although Big Pan is indeed on his feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.86,0:23:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if he has any\Nidea where he's at right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.92,0:23:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Zoro from the Straw\NHats is charging in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will he be able to overtake Big\NPan in his state of confusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.90,0:23:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that goes for the ref too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.72,0:24:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crowd, or rather the ref?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takes a direct hit from\Nthe flying pickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.00,0:24:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.24,0:24:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your red card.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My whistle and my cards are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a naughty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.88,0:24:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old habits die hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.70,0:24:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.68,0:24:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.90,0:24:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With victory in their grasp, the\NStraw Hats turn on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.84,0:24:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shame.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:47.56,0:24:51.70,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Armée de l'Air Power Shoot!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:47.56,0:24:51.70,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Air Force Power Shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.68,0:24:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A medallion!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.66,0:24:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power show!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.04,0:24:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.06,0:25:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Pan! What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.10,0:25:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The massive Wu-Tan warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.04,0:25:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.46,0:25:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They headed for the gold ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.26,0:25:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goal!

